<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Ocwen Financial rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ocwen Financial rated outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley started coverage of Ocwen Financial Corp, which went public in September, with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares were modestly higher, up 1/8 to 43.</p>
</text>
